## Project structure

```text
src/{{ project.package_name }}/   Package source
tests/                            Test suite
notebooks/                        Exploratory and reporting notebooks
```

## Working directories

These project-root directories hold local or generated working material. Git
ignores their contents, and nothing in the project creates them -- add each one
when you first need it.

```text
data/raw/         Immutable source data, exactly as received
data/interim/     Partially transformed data
data/processed/   Final datasets ready for modelling
models/           Trained and serialised models
artifacts/        Generated reports, figures, and run outputs
```

Never commit a dataset, a trained model, a generated binary, or a credential --
keep them in the ignored directories above or outside the repository.
